{"metrics":{"latencyMs":1461},"output":{"message":{"content":[{"reasoningContent":{"reasoningText":{"text":"User asks to think step by step: compute 17*23. Provide reasoning. Should give multiplication steps. Probably show breakdown: 17*20 + 17*3 = 340 + 51 = 391. Or use distributive property. Provide reasoning explicitly."}}},{"text":"**Step‑by‑step multiplication**\n\n1. **Write the product using the distributive (area) method**  \n   \\[\n   17 \\times 23 = 17 \\times (20 + 3)\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 17 by each part of the sum**  \n\n   * Multiply by 20:  \n     \\[\n     17 \\times 20 = 17 \\times 2 \\times 10 = 34 \\times 10 = 340\n     \\]\n\n   * Multiply by 3:  \n     \\[\n     17 \\times 3 = 51\n     \\]\n\n3. **Add the two partial results together**  \n   \\[\n   340 + 51 = 391\n   \\]\n\n4. **Conclusion**  \n\n   \\[\n   \\boxed{391}\n   \\]"}],"role":"assistant"}},"stopReason":"end_turn","usage":{"inputTokens":85,"outputTokens":240,"serverToolUsage":{},"totalTokens":325}}538 2384
